/.homonto/
.env
# Release build output from scripts/build-release.sh.
/dist/
# Locally-built binaries (e.g. `go build .`).
/homonto
graphify-out/
__pycache__/
# Per-developer tool state (machine-specific). The repo does not dogfood
# homonto, so nothing here is projected — these hold each developer's own
# Claude Code / OpenCode setup.
/.claude/
/.opencode/
/opencode.json

# Workflow scaffolding. Comet drives big development, but its artifacts are
# working-tree scratch, not repository content: proposals, delta specs, tasks,
# plans, and verification reports describe how a change was produced, not what
# the code does. The durable record of a decision is an ADR in docs/adr/.
# See docs/agents/comet.md.
/.superpowers/
/openspec/
/docs/superpowers/
# The Comet selection record is transient state that gets committed by
# accident with a stale branch name (docs/agents/comet.md). The rest of
# /.comet/ — notably config.yaml — stays tracked.
/.comet/current-change.json

# OKF grounding bundle — generated from the code, regenerated on demand.
/okf_bundle/

/.handoff.md
